      "Possible mild hypothyroidism on thyroid panel"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "X-ray showing clinodactyly and short stature skeletal features",
      "Brain MRI may show nonspecific mild cerebral volume loss",
      "Echocardiogram revealing mild septal defects in some cases"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "TMEM67 (causative)",
      "Autosomal recessive inheritance"
    ],
